<title>RUSSIA: Cellular operator Vympelkom ends at $44 in Russia.</title>
<headline>Cellular operator Vympelkom ends at $44 in Russia.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Common shares of cellular telephone network operator AO Vympekom closed at $44 on volume of $33,000 on the company's first day on the Russian Trading System on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bid/ask spread was $42.50/$47.50.</p>
<p>Vympelkom American Depositary Receipts, which cover three-quarters of one share, on the New York Stock Exchange had risen to $33 at 1755 GMT on Tuesday from $31 3/8 at the close on Monday.</p>
<p>--Olga Popova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
